---
/**
 * @file ContactCard.astro
 * @description Sidebar contact card of the accommodation detail page. It is a PURE
 * contact surface (dates, guests, form, «o contactá directo» via the slotted island):
 * it never shows the host's identity. Owner decision (HOS-2520, 23/11/2026): the
 * «Tu anfitrión» section (`HostSection`) is the only place the host is presented, at
 * every width.
 *
 * Below 768px the card is hidden: the desktop `ListingContactCard` island hydrates
 * only from 768px up, so an unhydrated form must not show, and the contact path there
 * is the dock bar + panel. Public channels stay reachable on mobile in three cases,
 * all without JavaScript logic of their own:
 *   1. `:target`: «Consultar» links that fall back to `#contact` before their island
 *      hydrates reveal the card with the public channels instead of the form.
 *   2. `:has([data-contact-fallback]:not([hidden]))`: hydration failed and
 *      `ContactHostShell` revealed its fallback.
 *   3. `<noscript>`: JavaScript is off.
 */
---

<div class="contact-card" id="contact">
  <slot />
</div>
<noscript>
  <style is:inline>
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .contact-card { display: block !important; }
    }
  </style>
</noscript>
<style is:global>
  .contact-card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3, 12px);
    background-color: var(--core-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card, 24px);
    padding: var(--space-6, 24px) var(--space-5, 20px) var(--space-5, 20px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 200ms ease-out, box-shadow 200ms ease-out;
  }
  .contact-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--brand-primary) 0%, var(--brand-accent) 100%);
  }
  .contact-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-hover, var(--shadow-card));
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .contact-card {
      display: none;
    }
    /* Public channels only: the form belongs to the desktop island. */
    .contact-card:target,
    .contact-card:has([data-contact-fallback]:not([hidden])) {
      display: flex;
    }
    .contact-card:target [data-contact-form] {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .contact-card:target [data-contact-fallback] {
      display: flex !important;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .contact-card,
    .contact-card:hover {
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
